(254, 1, 'Daisy Diamond Ear Studs', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  daisy earrings look so chic and sleek, but at the same time simple, therefore\n  perfect for casual looks. They have been crafted in 18k white gold and\n  diamonds in full cut. They can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Daisy Diamond Ear Studs', '', ''),
