(269, 1, 'Square Shape Gold and Diamond Bangle', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;The\n  simple styling make it a great choice for everyday wear. Crafted in white\n  gold and diamonds it has a single row of petite diamonds along with plain\n  band giving it a very modern look. This bangle can be customized in all gold\n  colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Square Shape Gold and Diamond Bangle', '', ''),
(270, 1, 'Gemstones &amp; Diamond Floral Butterfly Bangle', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  artistic floral butterfly diamond bangle is embellished with the colors of\n  spring. This awe inspiring piece has been crafted using an array of gem\n  stones-garnet, ruby, sapphire and diamonds. It is available in all gold\n  colors and 14k gold purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Gemstones &amp; Diamond Floral Butterfly Bangle', '', ''),
