(505, 1, 'Diamond Cross Pendant', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  ornate cross, for both fashion conscious and the pious has been crafted in\n  18k gold and diamonds. It can be customized in all gold colors and\n  purity. It is available SI and VS clarity diamonds.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond Cross Pendant', '', ''),
