(509, 1, 'Halo Drop Diamond Hoop Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  halo earrings add a touch of class to any wearer. These dangling hoop\n  earrings have been crafted with 18k white gold and VS clarity diamonds. They\n  can be customized in any gold color and precious stone of your choice.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Halo Drop Diamond Hoop Earrings', '', ''),
