(532, 1, 'Diamond Shaped Diamond Stud Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  pair of diamond stud earrings in diamond shape have been designed in 18k\n  white gold with fine diamonds in micro pave setting. They can be customized\n  in all metal colors and gold purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond Shaped Diamond Stud Earrings', '', ''),
(533, 1, 'Leaf Link Diamond Bracelet', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;A 18k\n  gold tennis bracelet linked together with cluster leaf like shapes and round\n  rings. Made with fine diamonds. Available in all metal colors and 14k gold\n  purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Leaf Link Diamond Bracelet', '', ''),
(536, 1, 'Leaf Link Diamond Bracelet', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Tiny\n  leaves and circles joined together to form attractive bracelet in yellow and\n  white diamond. 18k yellow and white gold has been used to craft this alluring\n  piece. Customization available.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Leaf Link Diamond Bracelet', '', ''),
