(733, 1, 'Floral Waves Diamond Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Beautiful\n  and elegant, these 18k white gold and&amp;nbsp;diamond earrings softly curve from the\n  top. Four diamond and gold ribbons cascade into a brilliant leaf. They can be\n  customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Floral Waves Diamond Earrings', '', ''),
