(739, 1, 'Leaf Shower Diamond And Gold Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  white gold leaf and diamond earrings are truly a glittering work of art. They\n  have been fashioned in 18k gold and VS clarity diamonds. A shower of leaves\n  gracefully cascades into a bunch. They can be customized in all gold colors\n  and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Leaf Shower Diamond And Gold Earrings', '', ''),
