(899, 1, 'Trellis Hoop Drop Diamond Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Delicate\n  and beautiful, these diamond-studded 18k white gold earrings will add allure\n  to any outfit. Full cut white diamonds in VS clarity have been used to\n  fashion them. They can be customized in all gold colors.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Trellis Hoop Drop Diamond Earrings', '', ''),
(900, 1, 'Straight Line Diamond Pendant', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Straight-line white diamond pendant epitomizes simplicity. This pendant has been\n  inspired by geometric figures. The designer uses clean graphic lines to\n  create a spectacular design. This pendant in white diamond and 18k&amp;nbsp; rose\n  gold can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Straight Line Diamond Pendant', '', ''),
