(926, 1, 'Roll Over Diamond Bangle', '&lt;table style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl65&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;table width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;colgroup&gt;&lt;col width=&quot;338&quot;&gt;&lt;/colgroup&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl65&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;Rich in\n  Brilliance , This Diamond Bracelet Showcases Petite Round SI Clarity Single\n  Cut Diamonds Pave Set In 18K White Gold. The Diamonds Are Set Over The Top\n  Half Of This Hinged Bangle. It Can Be Customized In All Gold Colors.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Roll Over Diamond Bangle', '', ''),
(927, 1, 'Outstanding White Gold Bangle In 18K', '&lt;table style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl65&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;table width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl65&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;For A\n  Bold And Beautiful Look This Hinged Bangle Is Ideal. Crafted In 18K White Gold. This Bangle Can Be Customized In All Gold Colors.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Outstanding White Gold Bangle In 18K', '', ''),
(928, 1, 'Studded Cross Diamond Pendant', '&lt;table style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl65&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;table width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl65&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;This\n  Glowing Cross Pendant Reflects The Faith of The Wearer With Simplicity Of Its\n  Design. Crafted In 18K White Gold &amp;amp; Brilliant Cut Diamonds , It Can Be\n  Customized In All Gold Colors &amp;amp; Purity.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Studded Cross Diamond Pendant', '', ''),
(929, 1, 'Heavenly Diamond &amp; Gold Cross Pendant', '&lt;table style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl65&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;table width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;colgroup&gt;&lt;col width=&quot;338&quot;&gt;&lt;/colgroup&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl65&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;Purposely\n  Placed Floral Diamond Clusters In Bezel Setting On The Edges &amp;amp; Tiny\n  Diamonds In Micro Pave Setting All Over Reflect The Warmth &amp;amp; Faith. It\n  Can Be Customized In All Gold Colors &amp;amp; Purity.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Heavenly Diamond &amp; Gold Cross Pendant', '', ''),
