(938, 1, 'Channel Set Diamond And Gold Cross Pendant In 18K Gold', '&lt;table style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl65&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;table width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl65&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;This\n  Simple Yet Elegant Cross Has Been Crafted In 18K Gold &amp;amp; Diamonds In\n  Channel Setting. It Can Be Customized In All Gold Colors And Purity.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Channel Set Diamond And Gold Cross Pendant In 18K Gold', '', '');
