h=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;Traditional\n  diamond choker has been crafted in 14k yellow gold and SI clarity white\n  diamonds. This simple piece makes tasteful addition to your ensembles whether\n  formal or informal. It can be custom ordered.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond Choker Necklace In Prong Setting', '', ''),
(1111, 1, 'Four Leaf Clover Earrings In 18K White Gold', '&lt;table style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl65&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;table width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl63&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;table width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl63&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;This\n  charmed clover has been crafted in 18k white gold and vs clarity diamonds in\n  brilliant cut. The diamonds have been set in pave setting with milgrain\n  finish on the borders.The omega french clip at the back secures the earrings\n  perfectly.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Four Leaf Clover Earrings In 18K White Gold', '', ''),
(1112, 1, 'Graduated Diamnod &amp; Emerald Necklace In 14K Yellow Gold', '&lt;table style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl65&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;table width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl63&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;table width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl63&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;table width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl63&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;table width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;colgroup&gt;&lt;col width=&quot;338&quot;&gt;&lt;/colgroup&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl65&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;Graceful\n  and chic, this necklace has been crafted with alternating diamonds and\n  emerald in 14k yellow gold. The precious stones gradually taper till the mid\n  point and then are linked to a gold chain. It can be customized to suit your\n  choice.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Graduated Diamnod &amp; Emerald Necklace In 14K Yellow Gold', '', ''),
(1113, 1, 'White Gold And Diamond Bangle', '&lt;table style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl65&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;table width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;colgroup&gt;&lt;col width=&quot;338&quot;&gt;&lt;/colgroup&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl65&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;table width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl65&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;This\n  ever popular bangle has been crafted in 18k white gold and diamonds in\n  micro pave setting. White diamonds in single cut accentuate the beauty of the\n  bangle. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'White Gold And Diamond Bangle', '', ''),
(1118, 1, 'Sapphire , Diamond And White Gold Dangling Earrings', '&lt;table style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl65&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;table width=&quot;338&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td class=&quot;xl63&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;Svelte\n  an willowy, these earrings have been crafted in 18k white gold. Blue sapphire\n  studs along with diamond danglers on a chain form a pretty picture. They can\n  be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Sapphire , Diamond And White Gold Dangling Earrings', '', '');
