(1165, 1, 'Amity Necklace in Gold And Diamonds', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  awesome amity necklace depicting friendship and togetherness has been crafted\n  in 18k white gold and VS clarity diamonds in the brilliant cut. Micropave setting\n  has been used for a sleek finish.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Amity Necklace in Gold And Diamonds', '', ''),
(1166, 1, 'Double Square Diamond And Gold Pendant', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  irresistible double square necklace has been fashioned in 18k white gold and\n  brilliant cut white diamonds in micro pave setting. It can be customized in\n  all gold colors and purity.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Double Square Diamond And Gold Pendant', '', ''),
(1168, 1, 'Delicate Morganite, Ruby And Diamond Necklace In 14k Gold', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  necklace is unique and affordable. Morganite, ruby, and diamond have been set\n  in white gold to form a delicate pendant necklace. The gold chain is\n  connected with small beads at intervals. It can be customized in all gold\n  colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Delicate Morganite, Ruby And Diamond Necklace In 14k Gold', '', ''),
(1169, 1, 'Ornate Citrine and Diamond Necklace', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  ornate necklace has been crafted in 14k yellow gold. Diamonds in micro pave setting surround the citrine pear-shaped pendant. A delicate gold chain\n  connects the pendant. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Ornate Citrine and Diamond Necklace', '', ''),
(1171, 1, 'Chevron Danglers in White Gold And Diamonds', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;The\n  simple and clean lines of these dangler earrings are eye-catching. The pure\n  form enhances the elegance of these earrings. They have been crafted in 18k\n  white gold and round brilliant diamonds in micro pave setting. It can be\n  custom created.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Chevron Danglers in White Gold And Diamonds', '', ''),
(1172, 1, 'Elegant Diamond Drop Earrings In White Gold', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  elegant petal-shaped earrings have been crafted in 18k white gold and VS\n  clarity diamonds in brilliant cut. The Micro pave setting gives a smooth and shiny\n  finish to the necklace. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Elegant Diamond Drop Earrings In White Gold', '', ''),
(1173, 1, 'Elegant Diamond Necklace In White Gold', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  elegant petal-shaped necklace has been crafted in 18k white gold and VS\n  clarity diamonds in the brilliant cut. Micro pave setting gives a smooth and shiny\n  finish to the necklace. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Elegant Diamond Necklace In White Gold', '', ''),
(1174, 1, 'Contemporary Diamond And Gold Dangle Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  contemporary minimalistic earrings have been crafted in 18k white gold and VS clarity white diamond. The double circle earring with diamond in a bezel\n  setting is classy. It can be customized.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Contemporary Diamond And Gold Dangle Earrings', '', ''),
(1175, 1, 'Halo Diamond Drop Earrings In 18K White And Yellow Gold', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  leaf-shaped diamond and gold earrings have been crafted in 18k white and\n  yellow gold. Diamonds in micro pave setting shimmer in 18k white gold. A\n  plain yellow-gold petal surrounds the central leaf.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Halo Diamond Drop Earrings In 18K White And Yellow Gold', '', ''),
(1176, 1, 'Butterfly Trio Diamond &amp; 18K Gold Necklace ', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Dainty\n  and Delicate this trio butterfly necklace has been crafted in 18k white and\n  yellow gold. Diamonds in micro pave setting add sparkle to the\n  necklace. A delicate cable chain completes the look.&amp;nbsp; It can be customized in all gold colors and\n  purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Butterfly Trio Diamond &amp; 18K Gold Necklace ', '', ''),
(1177, 1, 'Ladybird Diamond &amp; Gold Necklace 18K ', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  avant-garde necklace is unique in design and craftsmanship. It has been\n  fashioned in 18k yellow and white gold with brilliant cut diamonds in micro pave setting. It can be custom-made as per customers\' choice.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Ladybird Diamond &amp; Gold Necklace 18K ', '', ''),
(1178, 1, 'Enchanting Moon Necklace In 18K Yellow Gold &amp; Diamonds', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  enchanting necklace has been crafted in 18k white and yellow gold. Vs clarity\n  diamonds in pave setting enhance the grace of this necklace. A simple cable\n  chain joins the pendant. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Enchanting Moon Necklace In 18K Yellow Gold &amp; Diamonds', '', ''),
(1179, 1, 'Bell Flower Diamond &amp; 18K Gold Earrings ', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  impressive bell flower earrings are unique in design. They have been crafted\n  in 18k white and yellow gold. Golden prongs hold the brilliant-cut round\n  diamonds in place, adding oomph to the earrings. It can be customized in all\n  gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Bell Flower Diamond &amp; 18K Gold Earrings ', '', ''),
(1180, 1, 'Bell Flower Diamond &amp; 18K Gold Necklace ', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  impressive bell flower necklace is unique in design. It has been crafted in\n  18k white and yellow gold. Golden prongs hold the brilliant-cut round\n  diamonds in place, adding color to the pendant. The cable chain is in white\n  gold. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Bell Flower Diamond &amp; 18K Gold Necklace ', '', ''),
(1183, 1, 'Fancy Diamond And Moldavite Halo Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  flamboyant earrings have been crafted in 18k yellow gold. The moldavite\n  centerpiece in the emerald cut is highlighted with a halo of white diamonds. This\n  can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Fancy Diamond And Moldavite Halo Earrings', '', ''),
(1189, 1, 'Lucky Clover Pendant In 18K Rose Gold &amp; Diamond', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  refined clover pendant has been crafted in 18k rose gold and white diamonds\n  in brilliant cut. The central stone is round white diamond in vs clarity. The\n  four petals are studded with a melee of diamonds in micropave setting. It can\n  be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Lucky Clover Pendant In 18K Rose Gold &amp; Diamond', '', ''),
(1190, 1, 'Charmed Clover Pendant In White Gold &amp; Diamond ', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  four leaf clover pendant has been crafted in white gold and diamonds. The\n  outer edge is in white gold whereas the central part of the clover is studded\n  with diamonds in micropave setting. It can be customized in all gold colors\n  and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Charmed Clover Pendant In White Gold &amp; Diamond ', '', ''),
(1191, 1, 'Contemparory Heart &amp; Teadrop Necklace In Blue Sapphire And White Gold', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;This\n  winsome necklace has been crafted in blue sapphire , diamonds and gold. Three\n  sapphires are studded in a straight line with a halo of diamonds around them.\n  It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Contemparory Heart &amp; Teadrop Necklace In Blue Sapphire And White Gold', '', ''),
(1193, 1, 'Fashionable Earrings In Pink Sapphire, Diamonds And Gold', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;This\n  fashionable earrings has been crafted in 18k white gold with marquise shaped\n  pink sapphire and diamonds in micropave setting.&amp;nbsp; It can be customized in all gold colors and\n  purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Fashionable Earrings In Pink Sapphire, Diamonds And Gold', '', ''),
(1194, 1, 'Fashionable Necklace In Pink Sapphire, Diamonds And Gold', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;This\n  fashionable necklace has been crafted in 18k white gold with marquise shaped\n  pink sapphire and diamonds in micropave setting. A delicate chain joins it to\n  the pendant. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Fashionable Necklace In Pink Sapphire, Diamonds And Gold', '', ''),
(1196, 1, 'Dainty Daisy Ear Studs In 18K White Gold And Diamond ', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;This\n  endearing daisy ear studs have been crafted in 18k white gold and diamonds in\n  brilliant cut. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Dainty Daisy Ear Studs In 18K White Gold And Diamond ', '', ''),
(1197, 1, 'Dainty Daisy Diamond &amp; White Gold Necklace In Pave Setting', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;This\n  endearing daisy necklace has been crafted in 18k white gold and diamonds in\n  brilliant cut. A delicate cable chain is attached to the pendant. It can be\n  customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Dainty Daisy Diamond &amp; White Gold Necklace In Pave Setting', '', ''),
(1202, 1, 'Blue Sapphire &amp; Diamond Drop Necklace In 14K White Gold', '&lt;div&gt;&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;This\n  Enchanting Necklace With Pear Shaped Blue Sapphires Surrounded With A Halo Of\n  Diamonds Stationed At Regular Interval Is Pretty. It Has Been Crafted In 14K\n  White Gold And Can Be Customized In All Gold Colors &amp;amp; Purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;', '', 'Blue Sapphire &amp; Diamond Drop Necklace In 14K White Gold', '', ''),
(1204, 1, 'Linear Diamond Tennis Bangle In White Gold', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;This\n  conventional, infinitely wearable diamond bangle has been crafted in 18k\n  white gold and diamonds. This all time dazzler showcases brilliant cut\n  diamonds on the upper side of the bangle. It can be customized in all gold\n  colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Linear Diamond Tennis Bangle In White Gold', '', ''),
(1205, 1, 'Moonstar Diamond And Gold Necklace', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;This\n  fashionble moon star necklace has been crafted in 18k white gold and\n  brilliant cut white diamonds. Micropave setting adds to the sparkle. A\n  delicate chainis attached to the pendant. It can be customized in all gold\n  colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Moonstar Diamond And Gold Necklace', '', ''),
(1206, 1, 'Diamond Halo Earrings In 18K White Gold', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;These\n  conventional earrings have been crafted in 18k white gold and diamonds in\n  brilliant cut. Micro pave setting and&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;\n  plain gold edges provide extra protection to the diamonds. They can be\n  customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond Halo Earrings In 18K White Gold', '', ''),
(1207, 1, 'Trumphet Diamond &amp; White Gold Bangle', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;This\n  winsome matt finish open end bracelet is flexible. It can fit all sizes . It\n  has been crafted in 18k white gold and diamonds. Round brilliant cut diamonds\n  are studded on the edges in micropave setting.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Trumphet Diamond &amp; White Gold Bangle', '', ''),
(1208, 1, 'Serpentine Adjustable Diamond &amp; Gold Bangle 18K', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;This\n  pliable textured bangle has been crafted in 18k white gold&amp;nbsp; and diamonds. This hollow bracelet is\n  lightweight yet looks substantial. It fits all sizes. It can be customized in\n  all gold colors.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Serpentine Adjustable Diamond &amp; Gold Bangle 18K', '', ''),
(1209, 1, 'Exotica Diamond &amp; Gold Square Necklace 18K', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;This\n  bohemian pendant necklace has been crafted in 18k yellow gold and brilliant\n  cut diamonds. The delicate gold wire work with sprinkling of diamond make it\n  an enticing piece. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Exotica Diamond &amp; Gold Square Necklace 18K', '', ''),
(1210, 1, 'Japanese Fan Diamond And Gold Stud Earrings 14K', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;These\n  drop dead gorgeous earrings have been crafted in 14k white gold and diamonds.\n  The diamonds in briliant cut are studded all along the fan shape of the\n  earrings. The can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Japanese Fan Diamond And Gold Stud Earrings 14K', '', ''),
(1211, 1, 'Diamond Cluster Ball Pendant (14K)', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;This\n  globular pendant as the name suggests is spherical in shape. Brilliant cut\n  diamonds in pave setting are studded all around the pendant. It can be\n  customized inall gold colors and purity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond Cluster Ball Pendant (14K)', '', ''),
(1212, 1, 'Holy Cross White Gold &amp; Diamond (14K)', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;The\n  simple styling of this delicate cross pendant make it infinitely wearable. It\n  has been crafted in plain 14k white gold with three brilliant cut diamonds on\n  the edges. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Holy Cross White Gold &amp; Diamond (14K)', '', '');
INSERT INTO `oc_product_description` (`product_id`, `language_id`, `name`, `description`, `tag`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keyword`) VALUES
(1213, 1, 'Diamond  &amp; Yellow Gold Unique Cross 14K', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;A\n  brilliant expression of faith, this cross pendant beams brightly with\n  diamonds at regular interval. A halo of plain yellow gold surrounds the\n  central piece. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond  &amp; Yellow Gold Unique Cross 14K', '', ''),
(1214, 1, 'Double Halo Cluster Diamond Drop Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;102&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:76.5pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;102&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 76.5pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;Simple\n  and elegant, these earrings have been crafted in 18k white gold and round\n  brilliant cut diamonds. Micropave setting highlights the sparkle of these\n  earings They can be customized.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Double Halo Cluster Diamond Drop Earrings', '', ''),
(1215, 1, 'Gold Ball Diamond Hoop Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;These\n  diamond hoop earrings have been crafted in 18k white gold and diamonds. They\n  can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Gold Ball Diamond Hoop Earrings', '', ''),
(1216, 1, 'Diamond Pin Ball Necklace In White Gold 18K', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;This\n  charismatic necklace has been crafted in 18k white gold and melee diamonds. A\n  delicate chain is attached to the pin shaped pendant. It can be customized in\n  all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond Pin Ball Necklace In White Gold 18K', '', ''),
(1217, 1, 'Ball And Socket Diamond Hoop Earrings In Two Tone 18K Gold', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;98&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:73.5pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;98&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 73.5pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;Fascinating\n  in design, these two tone gold and diamond earrings have been crafted with\n  18k white and yellow gold. Micropave setting has been used to highlight the\n  sparkle. The front side of the ball is studded with melee diamonds and the\n  backside has a lattice of white gold. They can be custom created.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Ball And Socket Diamond Hoop Earrings In Two Tone 18K Gold', '', ''),
(1218, 1, 'Vintage Diamond Drop Earrings 18K', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;These\n  alluring earrings have been crafted with 18k white gold and melee of diamonds\n  in brilliant cut. Diamonds in micropave setting enhance the beauty of these\n  drop earrings. They can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Vintage Diamond Drop Earrings 18K', '', ''),
(1219, 1, 'Diamond Cushion Stud Earrings 18K', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;These\n  enticing earrings have been crafted in 18k white gold and white diamonds in\n  brilliant cut. Shaped like a square cushion, round diamonds are set in rows\n  in pave setting. The border of the earrings is highlighted with milgrain\n  finish to create an ornate look. It can be customized in all gold colors and\n  purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond Cushion Stud Earrings 18K', '', ''),
(1220, 1, 'Triple Line Diamond Halo Hoop Earrings ', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;These\n  glamorous hoop earrings have been crafted in 18k white gold and round\n  diamonds in brilliant cut. Micropave setting has been used to enhance the\n  sparkle of the earrings They can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Triple Line Diamond Halo Hoop Earrings ', '', ''),
(1221, 1, 'Halo Cushion Diamond Necklace 18K', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;This\n  exquisite cushion shaped pendant necklace has been crafted in 18k white gold\n  and vs clarity diamonds in brilliant cut. Micropave setting has been used to\n  enhance the sparkle. A halo of gold beads surround the pendant. It can be\n  customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Halo Cushion Diamond Necklace 18K', '', ''),
(1222, 1, 'Victory Halo Diamond Necklace', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Crafted\n  in white gold and diamonds this necklace is made by joining together small\n  squares. Shaped like a V , it can be customized in all gold colors and\n  purity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Victory Halo Diamond Necklace', '', ''),
(1223, 1, 'Tear Drop Mini Diamond Halo Necklace 18K', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  pretty-pretty tear drop necklace has been crafted in 18k white gold and\n  diamonds. Micropave setting has been used to set the diamonds in centre and a\n  halo of gold beads surround them. A delicate gold chain is attached to the\n  necklace. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Tear Drop Mini Diamond Halo Necklace 18K', '', ''),
(1224, 1, 'Diamond &amp; Gold Studs In Pave And Miligrain Setting (18K)', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  ear studs are as pretty as the picture. They have been crafted in 18k white\n  and rose gold. VS clarity diamonds in micro pave setting have been used in\n  the centre. The ear studs are highlighted with milgrain finish on the edges.\n  They can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond &amp; Gold Studs In Pave And Miligrain Setting (18K)', '', ''),
(1225, 1, 'Triple Triangle Diamond Halo Pendent 18K Gold', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  symmetrical triangle necklace has been crafted in 18k white gold and vs\n  clarity diamonds in brilliant cut. A halo of diamonds surrounds the central\n  triangle. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Triple Triangle Diamond Halo Pendent 18K Gold', '', ''),
(1226, 1, 'Galaxy Diamond &amp; Gold Round Pendant (18K)', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Like\n  the galaxy of stars this pendant necklace is crafted with white diamonds in\n  brilliant cut. Channel setting has been used to fix each and every piece of\n  the diamond. A halo of diamonds in pave setting surround the main pendant.\n  The round pendant is attached to a delicate white gold cable chain. It can be\n  customized in all gold colors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Galaxy Diamond &amp; Gold Round Pendant (18K)', '', ''),
(1227, 1, 'Diamond Halogen Disc Necklace In 18K', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Fashioned\n  in white gold and diamonds, this pendant necklace is facinating. It is shaped\n  like a disk and studded with brilliant cut diamonds in a triangle. A white\n  gold chain is attached to the pendant. It can be customized in all gold\n  colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond Halogen Disc Necklace In 18K', '', ''),
(1228, 1, 'Diamond Bar Necklace In 18K Gold', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  simple bar necklace has been crafted in 18k white gold and diamonds. Small\n  brilliant cut diamonds in pave setting with a border all around highlight the\n  beauty of the pendant. A delicate cable chain is attached to the pendant.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond Bar Necklace In 18K Gold', '', ''),
(1229, 1, 'Diamond Pitcher Pendant Necklace In 18K Gold', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  enticing pendant neecklace has been fashioned in 18k white gold and diamonds.\n  Shaped like a pitcher, it is studded with brilliant cut diamonds in micropave\n  setting. A delicate chain is attached to the pendant. It can be customized in\n  all gold colors and purity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond Pitcher Pendant Necklace In 18K Gold', '', ''),
(1230, 1, 'Cascading Leaf White Diamond And Gold Necklace ', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  cascding leaf necklace is unique in design and craftsmanship. Fashioned with\n  a melee of diamonds and white gold in micropave setting this piece is dainty.\n  It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Cascading Leaf White Diamond And Gold Necklace ', '', ''),
(1231, 1, 'Eight Facet Diamond Earrings In 18K White Gold', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  enticing huggie hoop earrings have been crafted in 18k white gold and vs\n  clarity white diamonds in brilliant cut. Shaped like a hexagon it is studded\n  with diamonds in micropave setting. They can be customized as per customer\'s\n  choice.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Eight Facet Diamond Earrings In 18K White Gold', '', ''),
(1232, 1, 'Diamond &amp; Gold Huggy  Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  fetching huggie&amp;nbsp; has been crafted in 18k white gold and brilliant cut\n  white diamonds. These timeless earrings are comfortable and easy to wear with\n  hinged clasp for pierced ears. It can be customized in all gold colors and\n  purity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond &amp; Gold Huggy  Earrings', '', ''),
(1233, 1, 'Diamond Cluster Stud Earrings In 18K White Gold', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;These\n  diamond stud cluster earrings have been crafted in 18k white gold and white\n  diamonds in brilliant cut. Micropave setting has been used to create a\n  seamless look. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond Cluster Stud Earrings In 18K White Gold', '', ''),
(1234, 1, 'Simply Beatuiful Diamond Cluster Stud Earrings In 18K Gold', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  diamond stud cluster earrings have been crafted in 18k white gold and white\n  diamonds in brilliant cut. Micropave setting has been used to create a\n  seamless look. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Simply Beatuiful Diamond Cluster Stud Earrings In 18K Gold', '', ''),
(1235, 1, 'Diamond &amp; Gold Braid Earrings (18K)', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  stunnning braided earrings have been fashioned in 18k white gold and\n  diamonds. The masterful intermingling of diamonds and gold have made the\n  earrings very classy. They can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond &amp; Gold Braid Earrings (18K)', '', ''),
(1236, 1, 'Symmetry Diamond &amp; White Gold Bangle', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Sleek\n  and contoured this bangle has been crafted in 18k white and yellow gold.\n  Diamonds in brilliant cut on the square crest add to the simplicity. It can\n  be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Symmetry Diamond &amp; White Gold Bangle', '', ''),
(1237, 1, 'Generic Earrings In Gold And Diamond', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  modest earrings have been crafted in 18k two tone gold and white diamonds in\n  brilliant cut. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Generic Earrings In Gold And Diamond', '', ''),
(1238, 1, 'Generic Necklace in Gold And Diamonds', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  modest necklace has been crafted in 18k two tone gold and white diamonds in\n  micropave setting. A simple cable chain is atached to the pendant. It can be\n  customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Generic Necklace in Gold And Diamonds', '', ''),
(1239, 1, 'Diamond Evil Eye Protection Necklace (18K)', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Unique\n  in shape and design, this evil eye necklace has been crafted in 18k white\n  gold and diamonds. The pupil is enamelled in blue color. It can be customized\n  in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond Evil Eye Protection Necklace (18K)', '', ''),
(1246, 1, 'Stylish Diamond &amp; White Gold Geometric Necklace ', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  pretty geometric necklace is a combination of rohmbus and irregular hexagons\n  studded with diamonds in pave setting. The pendant is linked to a delicate\n  chain in white gold. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Stylish Diamond &amp; White Gold Geometric Necklace ', '', ''),
(1247, 1, 'Geometric Diamond &amp; Yellow Gold Modern Necklace ', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  geometric necklace is designed in two tone gold and vs clarity diamonds in\n  brilliant cut. The pendant is hexagon shape and studded with diamonds in\n  micropave setting. A delicate chain is attached to the necklace.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Geometric Diamond &amp; Yellow Gold Modern Necklace ', '', ''),
(1248, 1, 'Graphic Diamond &amp; Gold Necklace In 18K', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  symmetrical square necklace has been crafted in 18k white and yellow\n  gold.&amp;nbsp; Two squares in yellow and white\n  gold are affixed to a small delicate chain. The small square is studded with\n  diamonds in micropave setting. It can be customized.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Graphic Diamond &amp; Gold Necklace In 18K', '', ''),
(1249, 1, 'Oblong White &amp; Yellow Gold Diamond Studded Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  new fashioned oblong earrings has been crafted in 18k two tone gold and white\n  diamonds in brilliant cut. Micropave setting make it seamless and shiny. It\n  can be customized in all gold colors and purity&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Oblong White &amp; Yellow Gold Diamond Studded Earrings', '', ''),
(1250, 1, 'Oblong White &amp; Yellow Gold Diamond Studded Necklace', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  new fashioned oblong necklace has been crafted in 18k two tone gold and white\n  diamonds in brilliant cut. Micropave setting make it seamless and shiny. It\n  can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Oblong White &amp; Yellow Gold Diamond Studded Necklace', '', ''),
(1252, 1, 'Chic Diamond &amp; Gold Earring In Pave Setting', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Styled\n  like a paperclip, this design is contemporary. It has been crafted in 18k\n  white and yellow gold with a few diamonds to give it sheen. It can be\n  customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Chic Diamond &amp; Gold Earring In Pave Setting', '', ''),
(1253, 1, 'Chic Diamond &amp; Gold Necklace In Pave Setting', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Styled\n  like a paperclip, this design is contemporary. It has been crafted in 18k\n  white and yellow gold with a few diamonds to give it sheen. It can be\n  customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Chic Diamond &amp; Gold Necklace In Pave Setting', '', ''),
(1255, 1, 'Attractive Diamond Studded Triangle Necklace In 18K Yellow Gold', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Modern\n  and minimalistic, this triangle necklace is crafted in 18k yellow and white\n  gold. Brilliant cut diamonds on the base of the triangular pendant add a\n  novel touch. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Attractive Diamond Studded Triangle Necklace In 18K Yellow Gold', '', ''),
(1256, 1, 'Gorgeous Yellow Gold Bangle With Diamond Flower', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Simple\n  and stylish, this gold bangle has been crafted in 18k two tone yellow and\n  white gold. Diamonds in micropave setting are studded on a small flower. The\n  bangle is styled like a rope. It can be customized in all gold colors and\n  purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Gorgeous Yellow Gold Bangle With Diamond Flower', '', ''),
(1257, 1, 'Double Line Diamond And Gold Layered Necklace', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  layered necklace is delicate and trendy. It has been crafted in 18k white and\n  yellow gold. White diamonds in brilliant cut are studded on the pear shaped\n  pendant. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Double Line Diamond And Gold Layered Necklace', '', ''),
(1258, 1, 'Triple Line Chevron Diamond &amp; Gold Necklace ', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  layered necklace is delicate and trendy. It has been crafted in 18k white and\n  yellow gold. White diamonds in brilliant cut are studded on the v shaped\n  pendant. It can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Triple Line Chevron Diamond &amp; Gold Necklace ', '', ''),
(1259, 1, 'Diamond &amp; Gold Double Tear Drop Pendant With Floral Centre', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  beautiful piece has been crafted in in 18k two tone yellow and white gold.\n  Brilliant cut round diamonds are studded on the inner tear drop whereas the\n  outer tear drop is in plain gold. It can be customized in all gold colors and\n  purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond &amp; Gold Double Tear Drop Pendant With Floral Centre', '', ''),
(1260, 1, 'Claire Round Pendant Necklace In Yellow Gold &amp; Diamond ', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  pretty pendant necklace has been crafted in two tone yellow and white gold.\n  The outer ring of the pendant is studded with brilliant cut round diamonds.\n  The inner ring is in plain gold the central swinging piece is studded with\n  diamonds in micropave setting. The piece can be customized to as per\n  requirement.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Claire Round Pendant Necklace In Yellow Gold &amp; Diamond ', '', ''),
(1261, 1, 'Diamond &amp; Gold Tear Drop Necklace With Pink Sapphire ', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  radiant tear drop necklace has been crafted with 18k yellow and white gold.\n  Pink swinging sapphire in the center is surrounded by a halo of white\n  diamonds in pave setting. It can be customized as per customer\'s choice.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond &amp; Gold Tear Drop Necklace With Pink Sapphire ', '', ''),
(1262, 1, 'Haute Couture Diamond &amp; Yellow Gold Necklace In 18K', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  drop dead gorgeous in have been crafted kl 18k white gold &amp;amp; diamonds. The\n  diamonds kl briliouturet cut are studded all along the couture shape of the\n  in. The can be customized kl all gold colors &amp;amp; purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Haute Couture Diamond &amp; Yellow Gold Necklace In 18K', '', ''),
(1263, 1, 'Trendy Diamond Shaped Gold &amp; Diamond Pendant', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Trendy\n  and hip, this pendant necklace has been crafted in 18k gold. The pendant is\n  made of two kite shaped rhombus. The outer rhombus is made of plain rose gold\n  and the inner rhombus is in white gold studded with diamonds in micropave\n  setting. A delicate chain is attached to the pendant. It can be customized in\n  all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Trendy Diamond Shaped Gold &amp; Diamond Pendant', '', ''),
(1264, 1, 'Diamond &amp; White Gold Station Bangle', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  tantalizing bangle has been crafted in 18k white gold and diamonds in\n  brilliant cut. Melee diamonds are place in a floral patern at regular\n  interval in micropave setting. This bangle can be customized in all gold\n  colors and purity&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond &amp; White Gold Station Bangle', '', ''),
(1265, 1, 'Enchanting Gold &amp; Diamond Bow Bangle', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  alluring bangle has been crafted in 18k rose gold and vs clarity diamonds in\n  brilliant cut. The bangle is plain gold with diamond studded bow on top.\n  Channel set pave has been used to secure the diamonds. It can be customized\n  in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Enchanting Gold &amp; Diamond Bow Bangle', '', ''),
(1292, 1, 'Leaf Shower Diamond And Gold Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  yellow gold leaf and diamond earrings are truly a glittering work of art.\n  They have been fashioned in 18k gold and VS clarity diamonds. A shower of\n  leaves gracefully cascades into a bunch. They can be customized in all gold\n  colors and purity.&lt;br&gt;\n    &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Leaf Shower Diamond And Gold Earrings', '', ''),
(1295, 1, 'Butterfly Diamond Necklace', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Dainty\n  and delicate this necklace has been crafted in 18k white gold. Brilliant cut\n  diamonds have been set in highly polished white gold for sparkle. It can be\n  customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Butterfly Diamond Necklace', '', ''),
(1296, 1, 'Butterfly Diamond Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Dainty\n  and delicate these earrings have been crafted in 18k white gold. Brilliant\n  cut diamonds have been set in highly polished white gold for sparkle. They\n  can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Butterfly Diamond Earrings', '', ''),
(1300, 1, 'Petite Diamond Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  petite diamond earrings tell a story of love and friendship. They have been\n  crafted in 18k white gold and white diamonds in brilliant cut. These earrings\n  can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Petite Diamond Earrings', '', ''),
(1301, 1, 'Golden Shower Diamond And Gold Necklace', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  yellow gold leaf and diamond necklace are truly a glittering work of art.\n  They have been fashioned in 18k gold and VS clarity diamonds. A shower of\n  leaves gracefully cascades into a bunch. They can be customized in all gold\n  colors and purity.&lt;br&gt;\n    &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Golden Shower Diamond And Gold Necklace', '', ''),
(1302, 1, 'Solitaire Diamond And Gold Studs', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Elegant\n  in simplicity these diamond solitaire stud earrings have been crafted in 18k\n  white gold and VS quality diamonds . The full cut brings out the sparkle and\n  shine in the earrings&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Solitaire Diamond And Gold Studs', '', ''),
(1306, 1, 'Gold And Diamond floral tennis necklace', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  trendy chain necklace is in vogue. It can be paired with a tennis bracelet\n  for a modern look. It has been crafted in 18k white gold and diamonds and\n  can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Gold And Diamond floral tennis necklace', '', ''),
(1307, 1, 'Dangling Rain Drop Earrings in Gold And Diamond', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  pretty rain drop earrings have been fashioned in 18k White gold and VS1 diamonds. Pave setting has been used to secure the diamonds. It can be\n  customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Dangling Rain Drop Earrings in Gold And Diamond', '', ''),
(1308, 1, 'Gold And Diamond Straight Line Dangle Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  aesthetically appealing dangle earrings have been crafted in 18k gold and VS&amp;nbsp; clarity diamonds. Small flowers at regular interval on diamond and gold chain\n  have been designed in pave setting with milgrain finish on sides. It can be\n  customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Gold And Diamond Straight Line Dangle Earrings', '', ''),
(1314, 1, 'Rain Drop Diamond And Gold Tennis Bracelet', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;This\n  bewitching rain drop tennis bracelet has been crafted in 18k White gold and\n  VS diamonds. Perfect for everyday wear, this piece will accessorize your\n  look.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Rain Drop Diamond And Gold Tennis Bracelet', '', ''),
(1316, 1, 'Geometric Diamond And Gold Tennis Bracelet', '&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;Stay\n  gorgeously trendy and modern with this geometric bracelet. Crafted in 18k White gold and round brilliant cut diamonds, it will add a touch of\n  sophistication to your ensemble.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Geometric Diamond And Gold Tennis Bracelert', '', ''),
(1317, 1, 'Diamond And Gold Clover Tennis Bracelet', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;This\n  exquisite tennis bracelet embodies timeless glamour. It has been crafted in\n  18k White gold and diamonds in brilliant cut. Small flowers at regular\n  interval in pave setting add to the glamour. Box clasp makes it secure on\n  your hands. It can be customized in all gold colors and clarity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Diamond And Gold Clover Tennis Bracelet', '', ''),
(1321, 1, 'Gold And Diamond Clover Stud Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;These\n  stylish yet forever earrings have been crafted in 18k White gold and VS clarity diamonds in full cut. Milgrain finish on the edges enhance the beauty\n  of these earrings. They can be customized in all gold colors and purity.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Gold And Diamond Clover Stud Earrings', '', ''),
(1324, 1, 'Rain Drop Diamond And Gold Necklace', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;Indulge\n  Yourself With This 18K Gold And Diamond Necklace In Pave Setting. This Piece\n  Will Accessorize Your Look With Elegance. It Can Be Customized In All Gold\n  Colours.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Rain Drop Diamond And Gold Necklace', '', ''),
(1327, 1, 'Pretty Rain Drop Gold And Diamond Ear Studs', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;These\n  pretty rain drop earrings have been fashioned in 18k White gold and\n  diamonds. Pave setting has been used to secure the diamonds. It can be\n  customized in all gold colors and purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Pretty Rain Drop Gold And Diamond Ear Studs', '', ''),
(1330, 1, 'Geometric Diamond And Gold Dangle Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;Stay\n  gorgeously trendy and modern with these geometric dangle earrings. Crafted in\n  18k White gold and round brilliant cut diamonds, they add a touch of\n  sophistication to your ensemble.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Geometric Diamond And Gold Dangle Earrings', '', '');
INSERT INTO `oc_product_description` (`product_id`, `language_id`, `name`, `description`, `tag`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keyword`) VALUES
(1333, 1, 'Geometric Diamond And Gold Necklace', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;Stay\n  gorgeously trendy and modern with this geometric necklace. Crafted in 18k\n  White gold and round brilliant cut diamonds, it will add a touch of\n  sophistication to your ensemble.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Geometric Diamond And Gold Necklace', '', ''),
(1336, 1, 'Imperial Diamond And Gemstone Bracelet', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  imperial gemstone bracelet has been fashioned using topaz, amethyst, pink\n  sapphire, blue sapphire and diamonds in 14k white gold. This piece offers\n  sophistication to simplest of the evening attire. It can be customized in all\n  gold colors, purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Imperial Diamond And Gemstone Bracelet', '', ''),
(1337, 1, 'Royal Topaz And blue Sapphire Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;These\n  winsome earrings in blue topaz and sapphire are crafted in 14k white gold.\n  The center piece is in emerald cut and rests on four tiger prongs. It is\n  surrounded by a halo of blur sapphire in brilliant cut in pave setting.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Royal Topaz And blue Sapphire Earrings', '', ''),
(1338, 1, 'Royal Amethyst And Pink Sapphire Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;These\n  grand oval halo gemstone earrings have been fashioned using amethyst and pink\n  sapphire in 14k white gold. The centerpieces is supported by four\n  prongs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Royal Amethyst And Pink Sapphire Earrings', '', ''),
(1339, 1, 'Imperial Diamond And Gemstone Necklace', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  imperial gemstone neklace has been fashioned using topaz, amethyst, pink\n  sapphire, blue sapphire and diamonds in 14k white gold. This piece offers\n  sophistication to simplest of the evening attire. It can be customized in all\n  gold colors, purity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Imperial Diamond And Gemstone Necklace', '', ''),
(1340, 1, 'Charismatic Diamond and Citrine Heart Necklace', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  captivating heart necklace is delicate and stylish. The delicate pendant\n  hangs from a white gold chain. The pendant has a unique design. One half of\n  the pendant is studded with citrine whereas the other side is hollow and\n  outlined with brilliant cut diamonds. It can be customized.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Charismatic Diamond and Citrine Heart Necklace', '', ''),
(1342, 1, 'Charismatic Diamond and Amethyst Heart Necklace', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  captivating heart necklace is delicate and stylish. The delicate pendant\n  hangs from a white gold chain. The pendant has a unique design. One half of\n  the pendant is studded with amethyst whereas the other side is hollow and\n  outlined with brilliant cut diamonds. It can be customized.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Charismatic Diamond and Amethyst Heart Necklace', '', ''),
(1343, 1, 'Radiant Floral Topaz Hoop Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  earrings are colourful and stunning. They have been fashioned in 14k white\n  gold, topaz and diamonds. Diamonds are studded around beautiful topaz petals.\n  The combination of topaz and diamonds add an extra touch of sparkle to the\n  earrings. They can be customized as per customer\'s choice.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Radiant Floral Topaz Hoop Earrings', '', ''),
(1344, 1, 'Radiant Floral  Citrine Hoop Earrings', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  earrings are colourful and stunning. They have been fashioned in 14k yellow\n  gold, citrine and diamonds. Diamonds are studded around beautiful citrine\n  petals. The combination of citrine and diamonds add an extra touch of sparkle\n  to the earrings. They can be customized as per customer\'s choice.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Radiant Floral  Citrine Hoop Earrings', '', ''),
(1347, 1, 'Radiant Floral Topaz Pendant', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  pendant is colourful and stunning. It has been fashioned in 14k white gold,\n  topaz and diamonds. Diamonds are studded around beautiful topaz petals. The\n  combination of topaz and diamonds add an extra touch of sparkle to the\n  pendant. It can be customized as per customer\'s choice.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Radiant Floral Topaz Pendant', '', ''),
(1348, 1, 'Radiant Floral Citrine Pendant', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; height: 75pt; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;This\n  pendant is colourful and stunning. It has been fashioned in 14k Yellow gold,\n  citrine and diamonds. Diamonds are studded around beautiful citrine petals.\n  The combination of citrine and diamonds add an extra touch of sparkle to the\n  pendant. It can be customized as per customer\'s choice.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Radiant Floral Citrine Pendant', '', ''),
(1349, 1, 'Captivating Cosmos Earrings in Diamond And Pink Sapphire', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  captivating cosmos earrings, as the name suggests, are eyecatching. They have\n  been fashioned in 14k white gold, diamonds and Pink Sapphire. Both pave and\n  micropave setting has been used to accentuate the beauty of the piece. It can\n  be customized as per customers requirement.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;189&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 142pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;20&quot; style=&quot;height:15.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;20&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;189&quot; style=&quot;height:15.0pt;width:142pt&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Captivating Cosmos Earrings in Diamond And Pink Sapphire', '', ''),
(1350, 1, 'Captivating Cosmos Earrings in Diamond And Blue Sapphire', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;These\n  captivating cosmos earrings, as the name suggests, are eyecatching. They have\n  been fashioned in 14k yellow gold, diamonds and blue sapphire. Both pave and\n  micropave setting has been used to accentuate the beauty of the piece. It can\n  be customized as per customers requirement.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;189&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 142pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;20&quot; style=&quot;height:15.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;td height=&quot;20&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;189&quot; style=&quot;height:15.0pt;width:142pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Captivating Cosmos Earrings in Diamond And Blue Sapphire', '', ''),
(1351, 1, 'Captivating Cosmos Pendant in Diamond And Pink Sapphire', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:75.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;This\n  captivating cosmos necklace, as the name suggests, is eyecatching. It has\n  been fashioned in 14k white gold, diamonds and Pink Sapphire. Both pave and\n  micropave setting has been used to accentuate the beauty of the piece. It can\n  be customized as per customers requirement.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Captivating Cosmos Pendant in Diamond And Pink Sapphire', '', ''),
