(1427, 1, 'Periwrinkle Diamond Pendant in   Micro Pave Setting', '&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify; width: 254pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;68&quot; style=&quot;mso-height-source:userset;height:51.0pt&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;td height=&quot;68&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;338&quot; style=&quot;height:51.0pt;width:254pt&quot;&gt;Trendsetting\n  and avant garde, this piece has been fashioned in 18k white gold and\n  diamonds. Styled like a flower, diamonds in briliant cut and micropave\n  setting add to the sparkle.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;', '', 'Periwrinkle Diamond Pendant in   Micro Pave Setting', '', ''),
